# STM32 / Keil repository ignore rules
# Build outputs and intermediate files
**/Objects/
**/Listings/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/build/
**/cmake-build-*/
*.o
*.d
*.crf
*.dep
*.lnp
*.map
*.lst
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.elf
*.out
*.a
*.lib
*.htm
*.bak
*.iex
*.scvd
*.uvguix
*.uvguix.*
*.dbg*
*.mxproject

# Archives and packaged third-party snapshots
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# Tool/editor caches
.vscode/*.log
.vscode/.ropeproject/
.idea/
.vs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Local/generated metadata
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Keep vendor-supplied CMSIS static libraries required by projects
!**/Drivers/CMSIS/Lib/**/*.a
!**/Drivers/CMSIS/Lib/**/*.lib

# Private local credentials (never commit)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ed25519
